hanconv
-------

The dictionaries in dictionary/ are the data files of OpenCC (Open Chinese Convert),
https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC, Copyright (c) 2010-2020 Carbo Kuo (BYVoid) and the OpenCC
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The files were taken unmodified from the copy bundled with github.com/liuzl/gocc (Apache License 2.0)
at version v0.0.0-20231231122217-0372e1059ca5 and are stored gzip-compressed. Only the 13 files used by
the supported conversions are included.

The conversion code in this package is an independent implementation; it does not contain code from
OpenCC, gocc or any trie library.
